OL,3,GNEWSAMore than #700m to be cut from
OL,4,AScottish Budget next year
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than #700m is to be cut from the
OL,7,FScottish government's Budget next year,
OL,8,Fthe country's official forecaster has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FThe Scottish Fiscal Commission (SFC)
OL,12,Fsaid the reduction would correct the
OL,13,Fdifference between forecast and actual
OL,14,Fincome tax revenues.
OL,16,FIn its annual report, the independent
OL,17,Fbody warned of less money for public
OL,18,Fservices in the 2026-27 financial year,
OL,19,Fas well as a worsening economic
OL,20,Foutlook, higher inflation and weak
OL,21,Fhousehold income growth.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
