OL,3,GNEWSAMore than #700m to be cut from
OL,4,AScottish Budget next year
OL,5,
OL,6,FPublic Finance Minister Hannah Mary
OL,7,FGoodlad said the Scottish government
OL,8,Fwould "take a responsible approach to
OL,9,Fmanaging the public finances".
